# Cloudflare Pages response headers (W002).
#
# Content-Security-Policy (enforced) holds only directives that cannot break any
# current feature. Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only is the target policy; browsers
# log each violation to the console without blocking anything. When the console is
# clean on every page, move it into the enforced header. Studio still uses inline
# event handlers, so script-src without 'unsafe-inline' will report there.
# Inline <script> hashes are checked by: node tools/csp-inline-hashes.mjs --check
